# Whitelist: ignore everything, then re-include the source, build and parameter files.
*
!*/

# Source code (C++ and the generated equation includes) and the build file
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.inc
!Makefile
!tools/*.py

# Parameter files (template and examples) and the seed profiles the examples read
!*.par
!examples/seeds/*.dat

# Vendored Eigen: extensionless headers and licence files
!third_party/**

# Documentation (README and the figures it shows)
!README.md
!docs/**
!.gitignore

# Never: run directories, paper sources, build products, Python caches
runs/
papers/
__pycache__/
*.o
*.d
rotating_bs_solver
